---
description: Synaptory git safety — no force history rewrite
globs: "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not `git push --force`, `git push --force-with-lease` onto a shared branch, `git reset --hard`, or `git checkout --force`. Do not `git commit --no-verify`. Synaptory boundary hooks deny these in the shell (`failClosed`). Ask the human if history repair is truly required.
